00:04:34,615 --> 00:04:40,615
Love makes monsters of us all.

2
00:09:09,230 --> 00:09:15,230
Crimson Peak is a horror, mystery, romance film directed by Guillermo del Toro.

3
00:13:43,846 --> 00:13:49,846
In the aftermath of a family tragedy, an aspiring author is torn between love for
her childhood friend and the temptation of a mysterious outsider.

4
00:18:18,461 --> 00:18:24,461
Trying to escape the ghosts of her past, she is swept away to
a house that breathes, bleeds… and remembers.

5
00:22:53,076 --> 00:22:59,076
Edith Cushing, played by Mia Wasikowska.

6
00:27:27,692 --> 00:27:33,692
Lady Lucille Sharpe, played by Jessica Chastain.

7
00:32:02,307 --> 00:32:08,307
Sir Thomas Sharpe, played by Tom Hiddleston.

8
00:36:36,923 --> 00:36:42,923
Dr. Alan McMichael, played by Charlie Hunnam.

9
