11
00:50:20,769 --> 00:50:26,769
Crimson Peak is a 2015 Gothic romance film directed by Guillermo del
Toro and written by del Toro and Matthew Robbins.

12
00:54:55,384 --> 00:55:01,384
The film stars Mia Wasikowska, Tom Hiddleston, Jessica
Chastain, Charlie Hunnam, and Jim Beaver.

13
00:59:30,000 --> 00:59:36,000
The story, set in Victorian-Era England, follows an aspiring author who travels to a remote
Gothic mansion in Cumberland, England with her new husband and his sister.

14
01:04:04,615 --> 01:04:10,615
There, she must decipher the mystery behind the
ghostly visions that haunt her new home.

15
01:08:39,230 --> 01:08:45,230
In 2006, a spec script written by Del Toro and Robbins was sold to
Universal Pictures, with Del Toro set to direct.

16
01:13:13,846 --> 01:13:19,846
Development was delayed due to scheduling conflicts.

17
01:17:48,461 --> 01:17:54,461
The film was described as a "ghost story and gothic romance" heavily inspired by
other horror films, such as The Haunting, The Innocents and The Shining.

18
01:22:23,076 --> 01:22:29,076
Principal photography began at Pinewood Toronto Studios in Toronto, Ontario on February 10,
2014, with additional filming in Hamilton, and ended on May 16 that year.

19
01:26:57,692 --> 01:27:03,692
The film was produced by Legendary Pictures and Del Toro's
production company, Double Dare You Productions.

20
01:31:32,307 --> 01:31:38,307
Crimson Peak premiered at Fantastic Fest on September 25, 2015, and was released in
the United States on October 16, 2015, in standard and IMAX formats.

21
01:36:06,923 --> 01:36:12,923
The film received generally positive reviews from critics but
underperformed at the box office,  grossing $74 million worldwide.

22
01:40:41,538 --> 01:40:47,538
The film received three nominations at the 21st
Empire Awards, including Best Horror.

23
01:45:16,153 --> 01:45:22,153
It received nine nominations at the 42nd Saturn Awards, winning three, including Best Horror
Film, Best Supporting Actress for Chastain and Best Production Design for Thomas E.

24
01:49:50,769 --> 01:49:56,769
The film explores themes of psychopath, poison, haunted house, mining, murder.

25
01:54:25,384 --> 01:54:31,384
The tone is mind_bending and dark and emotional.
